Package: polywallet
Type: Package
Title: Wallet-Level Polymarket Trading and Profitability Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Zhiru", "Guoli", email = "zguoli3@g.ucla.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: One row per Polymarket wallet for the week of 2026-09-29 to
    2026-10-05: trading-activity features computed from 6.8 million raw fills,
    plus conditional gross profit outcomes computed on every one of the 13,794
    markets with a recorded final outcome. Columns restricted to the 2,661
    blockchain-confirmed markets are included for robustness checks. Also
    ships the wallet-by-market pair table, column dictionaries, and helpers
    for modelling and insider-trading screening.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: stats, utils
